  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory Centre on WTO Law</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the Advisory Centre on WTO Law to provide developing and least developed countries (LDCs) with advice and training on WTO law and WTO dispute settlement proceedings. This helps developing countries and LDCs to understand and comply with their WTO obligations, which reduces the likelihood of disputes with trading partners, and enables them to participate more effectively in WTO rulemaking. It also assists developing countries and LDCs wanting to join the WTO and helps them to better integrate into the global rules-based trading system, implement domestic reform, and make a positive impact on the lives of their citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
